My DeepSeek (dsh-plugin-my-deepseek)
====================================

Bundled upstream work
---------------------
This package bundles the official DeepSeek chat demo front end:

  deepseek-ai/chat-demo
  Licensed under the MIT License — the complete text ships in vendor/LICENSE.

Modifications made to that source (all reproducible from scripts/):

  - design tokens are renamed from --dsw-* / --ds-* into a private --dsc-*
    namespace, and the dark-mode flag becomes body[data-dsc-dark], so the panel
    keeps the official palette without redefining the harness theme's tokens;
  - page-level body rules from global.css are scoped to .dsc-root;
  - the sidebar title renders the official wordmark instead of the demo's own
    "API usage demo" label;
  - conversation persistence goes through the host half (see src/store-api.ts)
    instead of IndexedDB.

